<ServiceLayout title="Shoulder Pain" description="Chiropractic treatment for shoulder pain at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH." schemaType="MedicalCondition">
<p>Shoulder pain can make everyday activities — reaching, lifting, sleeping — difficult or impossible. The shoulder is a complex joint with an extraordinary range of motion, which also makes it vulnerable to injury and dysfunction.</p>
<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />
<h2>Common causes</h2>
<p>Shoulder pain can result from rotator cuff injuries, frozen shoulder, bursitis, arthritis, or referred pain from cervical spine problems. Often, shoulder issues involve both the joint itself and the surrounding muscles and nerves.</p>
<h2>How we help</h2>
<p>Our approach includes evaluating both the shoulder joint and the cervical and thoracic spine, since misalignment in these areas can contribute to shoulder problems. Through targeted adjustments and soft tissue work, we can help restore function, reduce pain, and improve your range of motion.</p>
</ServiceLayout>
